 act, but a habit.","author":"Aristotle"},{"text":"It does not matter how slowly you go as long as you do not stop.","author":"Confucius"},{"text":"If I have seen further, it is by standing on the shoulders of giants.","author":"Isaac Newton"},{"text":"You cannot teach a man anything; you can only help him find it within himself.","author":"Galileo Galilei"},{"text":"The desire that guides me in all I do is the desire to harness the forces of nature to the service of mankind.","author":"Nikola Tesla"},{"text":"Success is not final, failure is not fatal: it is the courage to continue that counts.","author":"Winston Churchill"},{"text":"Live as if you were to die tomorrow. Learn as if you were to live forever.","author":"Mahatma Gandhi"},{"text":"The function of education is to teach one to think intensively and to think critically.","author":"Martin Luther King Jr."},{"text":"Education is the most powerful weapon which you can use to change the world.","author":"Nelson Mandela"},{"text":"Whatever you are, be a good one.","author":"Abraham Lincoln"},{"text":"You must do the thing you think you cannot do.","author":"Eleanor Roosevelt"},{"text":"The only thing worse than being blind is having sight but no vision.","author":"Helen Keller"},{"text":"Once you learn to read, you will be forever free.","author":"Frederick Douglass"},{"text":"An investment in knowledge pays the best interest.","author":"Benjamin Franklin"},{"text":"Stay hungry, stay foolish.","author":"Steve Jobs"},{"text":"When something is important enough, you do it even if the odds are not in your favor.","author":"Elon Musk"},{"text":"The biggest adventure you can take is to live the life of your dreams.","author":"Oprah Winfrey"},{"text":"One child, one teacher, one book, one pen can change the world.","author":"Malala Yousafzai"},{"text":"Imagination is the discovering faculty, pre-eminently. It is that which penetrates into the unseen worlds around us.","author":"Ada Lovelace"},{"text":"A man who dares to waste one hour of time has not discovered the value of life.","author":"Charles Darwin"},{"text":"There is nothing like staying at home for real comfort, but there is nothing like going out for real improvement.","author":"Jane Austen"},{"text":"One cannot think well, love well, sleep well, if one has not dined well.","author":"Virginia Woolf"},{"text":"I am my own muse, the subject I know best.","author":"Frida Kahlo"},{"text":"You may encounter many defeats, but you must not be defeated.","author":"Maya Angelou"},{"text":"Life can only be understood backwards; but it must be lived forwards.","author":"S\xf8ren Kierkegaard"},{"text":"That which does not kill us makes us stronger.","author":"Friedrich Nietzsche"},{"text":"Dare to know! Have the courage to use your own understanding.","author":"Immanuel Kant"},{"text":"The only fence against the world is a thorough knowledge of it.","author":"John Locke"},{"text":"Judge a man by his questions rather than by his answers.","author":"Voltaire"},{"text":"Beyond ideas of wrongdoing and rightdoing, there is a field. I\u2019ll meet you there.","author":"Rumi"},{"text":"A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.","author":"Lao Tzu"},{"text":"In the midst of chaos, there is also opportunity.","author":"Sun Tzu"},{"text":"We are twice armed if we fight with faith.","author":"Plato"},{"text":"Reserve your right to think, for even to think wrongly is better than not to think at all.","author":"Hypatia"},{"text":"I will not be triumphed over.","author":"Cleopatra"},{"text":"I am not afraid; I was born to do this.","author":"Joan of Arc"},{"text":"I praise loudly, I blame softly.","author":"Catherine the Great"},{"text":"Every great dream begins with a dreamer.","author":"Harriet Tubman"},{"text":"Truth is powerful and it prevails.","author":"Sojourner Truth"},{"text":"You must never be fearful about what you are doing when it is right.","author":"Rosa Parks"},{"text":"You cannot shake hands with a clenched fist